WEBVTT

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.150
♪ How I miss the ground! ♪

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.570
♪ Ho-yare-ho! ♪

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.070
♪ How I miss the worms! ♪

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:32.530
♪ Ho-yare-ho! ♪

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.610
♪ Stepping into... ♪

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.150
♪ ...a pitfall... ♪

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.440
♪ ...that your kid dug... ♪

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:42.110
♪ ...is a father's love! ♪

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:47.570
♪ Yare-ho! Yare-ho! Yare-ho-ho! ♪

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:51.400
Hey, bro?

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.820
What is it, bro?

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.570
What are we doing?

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:57.070
Isn't it obvious? We're rowing!

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.230
In the sky?

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.730
What's that got to do with it?

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.190
But there's no water.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.230
Yahoo! We're speeding along!

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.980
Are we even moving?

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.650
Oh! There's the floating continent.

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:11.860
Liar! We don't even have windows.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.980
--I heard a scary rumor.
--What was it?

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:19.150
Apparently, this ship is powered... by magic.

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:21.070
Magic?!

00:01:21.070 --> 00:01:22.400
Hey, what's that make us?!

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.110
What the hell have we been doing?!

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:25.860
That's the problem!

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:28.230
That's one hell of a problem!

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:31.030
What's all this "ho-yare-ho" for?!

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:33.440
Yare-ho! Yare-ho!

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:37.860
It's pointless, but ho-yare-ho!

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.940
It's time to change the guard!

00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:41.820
Huh?

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:42.980
Sir!

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:46.480
What were you three making
that awful racket for?

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.940
Nothing! We were just playing make-believe, sir!

00:01:48.940 --> 00:01:50.360
I see.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.860
No, I don't see!

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:54.360
Don't forget you're on duty!

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.860
No rations for the lot of you!

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:57.980
Aww...

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:24.480
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:29.530
<i>Under the "light and dark" called justice</i>

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:34.150
<i>our wishes run aground in twilight</i>

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:41.570
<i>If you want the tomorrow</i>
<i>on the other side of the mirror,</i>

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:43.570
<i>go through nightmares</i>

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:48.480
<i>Lives fragmented like the sea and sky</i>

00:02:48.480 --> 00:02:53.030
<i>Even if we realize that</i>
<i>their resemblance is false,</i>

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.780
<i>we can at least not give it words, give it form,</i>

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.400
<i>or doubt our bonds</i>

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:05.150
<i>and tell ourselves that</i>
<i>even blindness is a mercy</i>

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:07.690
<i>White or black? The scales of Libra</i>

00:03:07.690 --> 00:03:10.480
<i>waver cruelly</i>

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:15.690
<i>Together we cling, tenaciously,</i>
<i>to our sliver of a promise</i>

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:17.730
<i>We looked up at a nebula</i>

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.730
<i>of numberless dystopias</i>

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:23.400
<i>I crawled through the mud, mind ablaze,</i>

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:27.980
<i>and met you on the far side</i>
<i>of the scales of Libra</i>

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.980
"Shironeko Project ZERO CHRONICLE"

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.990
"Chapter 4"
"The Messenger from Black"

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.940
So, that's it.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:47.570
Please take care, Your Highness.

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:52.610
You may be going as a special envoy,
but our nations are still at war.

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:56.530
Speaking of which,
you're not exactly a great speaker.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.780
Can you do the envoy job?

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:02.940
I can deliver a letter.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.190
It's not gonna be that simple.

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:10.150
Like Groza said, Black and White
are in the middle of a war.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.610
If we're unlucky, we won't make it back.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:16.730
And if things go south,
the envoy'll be the first one to bite it.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.690
Adel!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:20.190
Whoa, don't get me wrong.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.030
I'm not trying to scare you.

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:25.150
I'm saying I'll play the part of
the envoy in public.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:26.400
What?!

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:31.150
You can pretend to be
my bodyguard, Your Highness.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:32.940
Why go that far?

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:34.530
You're gonna be king, right?

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:38.780
We can't have you sticking your neck out.

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:39.940
Adel.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:42.070
Come on, we're almost there.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:44.570
Let's go get booed.

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:07.980
Commander Phious!

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:10.650
Black sent you?

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:14.230
Damn you! I thought as much.

00:05:14.230 --> 00:05:17.440
Protecting the envoy is his bodyguard's job.

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:21.650
Please excuse his lack of courtesy.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.320
You're the envoy?

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:28.030
I believe you were officially
notified of our arrival.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.400
And here...

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:33.230
...is a letter from our king.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:36.690
You there.

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:37.400
Sir!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.610
Receive it.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:39.650
Yes, sir!

00:05:40.780 --> 00:05:43.860
We mean no harm. Lower your swords.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.860
I don't want to hear that from you.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.070
I can understand how you feel.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.900
But I am only a humble messenger.

00:05:50.900 --> 00:05:55.230
Besides, I don't believe you have the authority
to turn me back at this point.

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:58.400
You suddenly turned violent, so I cut you down.

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.730
No one would doubt my word.

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:03.820
Not even the Queen of Light?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:09.230
A knight's duty is to guard
the queen from all threats.

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:13.530
Please, don't be so furious.

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:14.980
Why not?

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.320
I'm fond of talking to myself.

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:25.780
What's the point of war?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.400
We should just stop it.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.780
Your people attacked us!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:34.190
Our leader is out of his mind.

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:39.820
And yet, no one can defy him.

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:41.570
Of course they can't.

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:45.150
We don't have the Progenitor Rune on the ground,

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.980
but the king himself is our equivalent.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:55.570
Most of the people probably don't care.

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:59.150
Our ruler decides their fates on a whim.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:01.530
Maybe that's just how things are.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:03.480
What's your point?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.030
But we civilian officers are different.

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.280
We've got no interest in war!

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:19.400
Maybe you should go back home and say that
instead of grumbling about it here.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:21.530
If I did that, I'd get this.

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:24.400
You assist in foolishness to save your skin?

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.400
That's what's wrong with your country.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.360
I completely agree.

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:32.480
I'd like to see a new king take over
as soon as possible.

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:34.190
Oh?

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:36.480
No other King of Darkness was like this.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:39.530
I don't know how they really felt,

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:42.940
but I hear they stayed put on the ground.

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.860
I hear the same.

00:07:45.860 --> 00:07:47.860
Then it must be true.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:51.690
Of course, I don't remember
the details for some reason.

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:57.530
Anyway, if we endure,
eventually someone else will become king.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:02.940
I think there's a point to us getting along,
for when that time comes.

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.820
I don't care. I'm just a knight.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:08.820
Really?

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.030
What?

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:14.230
Isn't guiding your lord in the right direction
part of a vassal's duty?

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:17.900
Are you telling me to do
what you can't do yourself?

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:20.440
You seem like you might be able to.

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:24.690
What's your name?

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.570
Adel.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:33.360
I'll defer cutting you down.

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:37.360
You seem unusually understanding
for a subject of Black.

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:40.730
I'm not so unusual.

00:08:40.730 --> 00:08:42.480
Leave your swords and wait here.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.690
I'll handle the formalities.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.360
Your Majesty.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:00.480
I will escort them.

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.400
Hey!

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:37.530
Demons!

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:39.780
Shh! Don't look!

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:45.190
Sounds like they've got some prejudice up here.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:50.190
I guess reforming civic consciousness
will be an important issue for both of us.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.360
What are you muttering about?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.650
You're an envoy, so show some manners.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.650
Whoops. Excuse me.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:10:00.690
You aren't speaking formally.

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.650
So, when do you leave?

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:06.900
Possibly today, if the negotiations go smoothly.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.570
Or so I'd like to say,

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:13.900
but I'm sure it will take a few days
to iron out the details.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.570
What a nuisance.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:18.280
I'm keenly aware of that.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.070
The barracks are nearby.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.530
I'll look in on my men.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:27.030
Is the knight commander permitted to
meet with special envoys at his discretion?

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.030
I just have to get permission.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.320
I have brought the messenger
from the Kingdom of Black.

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.360
Wait here.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:49.530
We will.

00:11:27.030 --> 00:11:28.860
Thank you for waiting.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:47.780
I have come from the Kingdom of Black.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:50.360
I am called Adel Batinder.

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:54.190
Please forgive my rudeness
for coming in my king's place.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.980
I have read your king's message.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:08.940
Majesty.

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:14.900
At present, relations between the kingdoms
of Black and White are far from amicable.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:19.820
In fact, the present situation could easily
lead to the destruction of either.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.730
It is as Your Majesty says.

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:23.730
Yet you propose an alliance?

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:27.570
While it is not always true that
the enemy of my enemy is my friend,

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:30.480
there are always grounds for a united front.

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:31.940
True.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:37.480
That appears in our land on a whim
and causes harm for no purpose.

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.820
In our land as well.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.980
I see.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:44.150
However,

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.730
once Bahl, the incarnation
of destruction, is defeated,

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:50.530
the King of Darkness's aggression
will be aimed solely at us.

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:59.150
Only under the current king.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:05.360
His Majesty is considering abdicating the throne
in the not-too-distant future.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:08.530
He has already reigned for
a considerable number of years.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:13.940
The Kingdom of Black wishes for
permanent balance with the Kingdom of White.

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:18.070
Pardon me, but is that
the King of Darkness's intention?

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:18.980
It is.

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:22.400
That strikes me as contradictory.

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:27.480
His Majesty is beyond my ability to fathom,
but he has said as much.

00:13:27.480 --> 00:13:30.730
I find that difficult to believe.

00:13:32.230 --> 00:13:35.940
What do you think,
Your Majesty Iris, Queen of Light?

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.900
I will give you my answer another day.

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:58.980
"No. 04 Skyships"
"Vehicles developed to allow the people of Black
to invade the skies. They differ fundamentally
from later, Rune-powered vessels."

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.900
So,

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:09.070
do you think the envoy
made it to the palace safely?

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.730
I thought they were gonna get killed
for a minute there.

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:14.530
I'm sure it worked out.

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:17.980
That envoy's a smooth talker.

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:20.190
Listen, you lot.

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:25.070
Do you have any awareness that you're on duty?

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:27.470
Sir! May I make a request, sir?

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:28.150
What?

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.980
Please call me by name, sir!

00:14:29.980 --> 00:14:32.400
I was thinking the same thing, sir!

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:37.230
If my predictions are correct, it might make us
unnecessarily difficult to distinguish, sir!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.570
What?

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:41.650
I can tell the three of you apart by sight.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.940
I'm sure that's good enough for you, sir!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.440
But are you everyone, sir?

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.110
No! There are lots more people!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.780
That's true, but...

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.820
Please use our names, sir!

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.280
All right!

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:55.440
I can tell you'll keep talking
for all eternity until I agree!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.650
All eternity?

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:57.900
No one's ever...

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.280
...lived that long!

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:02.820
Shut up! I'll call you by name,
you pack of morons!

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:04.320
Hooray!

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.820
You're Achibe!

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:06.650
Sir!

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:08.070
You're Bakase!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:09.150
Sir!

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:11.030
Wait, couldn't you pick anything better?!

00:15:11.030 --> 00:15:11.860
Shut up!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:13.530
And you're Ceechan!

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:14.690
That sounds like a nickname!

00:15:14.690 --> 00:15:16.150
Quit your whining!

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:18.400
You can be Chancee, then!

00:15:18.400 --> 00:15:20.530
You just picked "Achibe"
because it starts with "A"!

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:22.400
What an insulting name! Take it back!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.400
Doesn't "Ceechan" sound kind of girly?!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:26.650
Pipe down!

00:15:26.650 --> 00:15:30.860
You begged me for names
and now you don't want them?!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:32.940
You certainly seem to be having fun!

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:36.480
How nice! You act like you
don't have a care in the world!

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:39.230
--Yes, ma'am!
--Don't you "yes, ma'am" me!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:40.360
Ma'am?

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:42.900
Cleaning duty!

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.860
I want this ship sparkling from stem to stern!

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.650
Don't bother coming back until it's done!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:52.730
Yes, ma'am...

00:15:58.030 --> 00:15:59.150
Lady Groza!

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:01.190
Sir Vallus is calling for you.

00:16:07.030 --> 00:16:09.440
Step right up and take a look!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:12.530
I know times are hard, but looking glum
won't get you anywhere!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:15.150
I've got wheat, fruit, even drink!

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:18.650
Cheaper and finer than
you'll find anywhere else!

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.730
You there, pretty lady!
Why not stop and take a--

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:22.480
Shh!

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.860
Hmm? Wasn't that...

00:16:24.860 --> 00:16:26.530
That's Lady Groza.

00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:28.030
Oh, that's right!

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:29.900
She's as beautiful as ever!

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.190
Of course she is!

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:35.900
And Her Ladyship's not just good-looking;
she's got power to match.

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:39.190
I wonder if she's been summoned
to subdue something again.

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:41.480
Hey! Who told you that?!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.230
Everyone knows.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.190
A monster or something is on its way, right?

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.360
That's enough.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:49.280
Any more and I'll have a hard time
pretending I didn't hear.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:16:56.650
Your Highness,

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:58.480
please be safe.

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:23.070
Wait in this room.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:24.940
You are technically guests.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:28.190
Only technically?

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:30.980
Did you expect a warm welcome
for enemy messengers?

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.820
Forget I asked.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.730
Knight Commander Phious, sir.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:35.650
What?

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:38.730
What kind of person is Queen Iris?

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:43.400
Watch your tongue! The likes of you
should not speak her name so casually.

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:47.940
Do you want to curry favor
to get a favorable answer?

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:51.440
No, that's not what I meant.

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:56.070
Knight Commander, please forgive
our repeated insolence.

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:59.400
Eliminating Bahl is an important matter
for the Kingdom of Black as well.

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:02.900
Please consider our feelings of urgency.

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:07.690
Whatever you feel, it's none of your concern.

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.730
As you say.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.820
That was most impertinent of us.

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:23.940
All will be as Her Majesty decides.

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.530
The queen's decision...

00:18:32.530 --> 00:18:33.980
Hey.

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:35.480
Do you mind?

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.940
What's wrong?

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:40.440
I should be the one asking you that.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.440
What have you been doing all day?

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:47.570
You grab your sword as soon as we get here,
you offer opinions to the Queen of Light...

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.900
Cleaning up after you is wearing me out.

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:54.190
Well, I do know how you feel.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.320
They're a hardheaded bunch.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:19:00.650
I wonder if they can even
tell the two of us apart.

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:02.150
That's not...

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:04.070
You really think so?

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:09.150
They're sure that White is in the right
and Black is in the wrong.

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:14.230
The Queen of Light is probably trying to
find a way to turn the war in her favor.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.570
No!

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:19.860
I think she's... different.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:25.110
At least one of them was decent, anyway.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:28.860
It's not about Black and White.

00:19:30.530 --> 00:19:35.230
Well, whether the alliance is sealed or not
is up to the Queen of Light now.

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:39.730
Hurry up and get to bed, Your Highness.

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:49.150
Queen of Light...

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:52.070
...are you...?

00:19:57.280 --> 00:20:00.980
My duty as the Queen of Light.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.860
I will merely do my duty.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:15.690
That is my role.

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:25.730
Concerning the alliance...

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:26.820
Majesty.

00:20:26.820 --> 00:20:29.730
I have one question.

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:31.280
Ask anything.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:37.400
My question is for you.

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:45.440
But he's just a bodyguard, not an envoy.

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.230
All the more reason.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:53.780
How do the people of Black feel?

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.820
Your Majesty!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:03.110
You ought not ask such a question of a commoner!

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:18.780
Every time Bahl appears,
he puts many lives in danger.

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:24.280
But this alliance could save many lives.

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:58.610
I understand.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:04.190
Let us slay Bahl together.

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:21.280
<i>I walk the quiet streets alone</i>

00:22:21.280 --> 00:22:24.900
<i>in my memories</i>

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.360
<i>The times I can't see you</i>

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:34.690
<i>lead me a little astray, a fleeting light</i>

00:22:34.690 --> 00:22:44.150
<i>I want to touch your darkness,</i>

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:54.360
<i>what lies beyond it and its truth</i>

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:57.900
<i>Let me light your darkness</i>

00:22:57.900 --> 00:23:00.690
<i>Even if we're apart</i>

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:07.400
<i>Won't you let me light your darkness?</i>

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:10.190
<i>I'll find you</i>

00:23:13.900 --> 00:23:18.610
<i>Run, light,</i>

00:23:18.610 --> 00:23:21.940
<i>to where you are</i>

00:23:21.940 --> 00:23:24.780
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:26.690 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>Through the dark</i>

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.940
"Next Time"
"Chapter 5: United Front"
